{"id":"6010c0b5-6362-4287-b508-227e85e8c3d2","title":"Press Review – 06/12/2017","excerpt":"Here we are, with our weekly press review! As you may expect, you’ll find three sections: anime/manga, Games and game design/development. If you want news from additional sources, please ask in the comments! It’s much appreciated. Videogames The “Lootgate” EA has been under attack – or, better, under assault – by media, since its Battlefront 2 has pay-to-win mechanics veichled by loot boxes. Hawaii State has addressed EA’s Star Wars directly: This has been, of course, a heavy shot. Their...","firstPublishedDate":"2017-12-06T12:35:22Z","lastPublishedDate":"2017-12-06T12:35:22Z","url":{"base":"https://www.tzero.live","path":"/post/press-review-06-12-2017"},"slug":"press-review-06-12-2017","categoryIds":["6fecd53b-e26c-46ca-a508-d8b36cda3c3b"],"tagIds":[],"memberId":"38ba494c-02f6-400e-9e2d-5cb850448e7a","minutesToRead":3,"media":{"wixMedia":{"image":{"id":"38ba49_4fa5130f2a504acba484808dd06d4dc1~mv2.jpg","url":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/38ba49_4fa5130f2a504acba484808dd06d4dc1~mv2.jpg","height":566,"width":800}},"displayed":true,"custom":true},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Here we are, with our weekly press review! As you may expect, you’ll find three sections: anime/manga, Games and game design/development."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"If you want news from additional sources, please ask in the comments! It’s much appreciated."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Videogames"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"The “Lootgate”"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"EA has been under attack – or, better, under assault – by media, since its Battlefront 2 has pay-to-win mechanics veichled by loot boxes."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Hawaii State has addressed EA’s Star Wars directly:","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HTML","htmlData":{"containerData":{"width":{"custom":"640"},"alignment":"CENTER","height":{"custom":"360"},"textWrap":true},"html":"<iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_akwfRuL4os?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation\"></iframe>","source":"HTML"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"This has been, of course, a heavy shot."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Their chief financial officer, Blake Jorgensen, explains that they made the choice of including empowering items as loot – and not cosmetics only – because "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"“if you did a bunch of cosmetic things, you might start to violate the canon, right?”","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.polygon.com/2017/11/28/16711474/star-wars-battlefront-2-cosmetics-loot-boxes-lucasfilm-canon","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". Anyways, EA decided to disable the possibility of buying loot boxes with cash."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Then, other changes went live. You can check details from "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Eurogamer","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"http://www.eurogamer.net/articles/2017-12-04-initial-star-wars-battlefront-2-loot-box-related-changes-go-live","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Kotaku","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/star-wars-battlefront-ii-boosts-multiplayer-rewards-1820977427","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". and "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Polygon","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.polygon.com/2017/12/4/16733416/star-wars-battlefront-2-loot-boxes-credit-rewards-increased","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"The argument, though, wasn’t over. Just yesterday the same Blake Jorgensen spoke at the 37th Nasdaq Investor Conference saying "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"“It’s been a great learning experience for us”","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.gamespot.com/articles/ea-talks-battlefront-2-loot-box-controversy-its-be/1100-6455408/","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"A similar issue is the one relating to loot boxes as a gambling mechanics. This has been discussed earlier by major insitutions like "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"ESRB, which didn’t see them as gambling","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/esrb-says-it-doesnt-see-loot-boxes-as-gambling-1819363091","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", while "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Hawaii","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/hawaii-wants-to-fight-the-predatory-behavior-of-loot-1820664617","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":" firmly opposes to this practice, as seen above and "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Belgium","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.polygon.com/2017/11/22/16690182/battlefront-2-loot-crates-hawaii-belgium-banned-regulation-investigate","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"‘s Gaming Commission is investigating the risks. You can find additional information on this also on "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Kotaku","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/battlefront-overwatchs-loot-boxes-under-investigation-1820486239","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". The relations between this issue and EA’s Battlefront 2 “mediatic warfare” has been also "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"discussed at Forbes","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/insertcoin/2017/11/22/from-belgium-to-hawaii-potential-battlefront-2-loot-box-legislation-would-be-complicated/#4ca681877cbc","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"While one guy "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"builds a robot to grind loot boxes","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/guy-builds-robot-to-grind-badly-for-battlefront-ii-lo-1820710871","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":" out of the game, others just take this "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"hilariously","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/here-are-some-alternatives-to-loot-boxes-1820594297","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". Things, though, aren’t something you can always smile at, as "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Kotaku documented","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/meet-the-19-year-old-who-spent-over-10-000-on-microtra-1820854953","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":" and "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Rolling Stone discussed","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"http://www.rollingstone.com/glixel/news/teen-describes-10000-loot-box-habit-w512909","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Battlefront 2 is, though, not the only non-mobile-game featuring those mechanics. Company of Heroes 2, for instance, has a pretty similar mechanics."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"We’ll analyze the subject matter in our “Game Design Analyses” column in a few days."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Mega Man 11, Legacy and X series announced"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HTML","htmlData":{"containerData":{"width":{"custom":"640"},"alignment":"CENTER","height":{"custom":"360"},"textWrap":true},"html":"<iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8Kpsf5HRDO0?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation\"></iframe>","source":"HTML"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Spotlights are on "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Capcom’s Megaman 11 announcement","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"coming to PS4, Switch, XBox One and PC on late 2018","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.theverge.com/2017/12/4/16734780/capcom-mega-man-11-switch-release-legacy-collection-x","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". You can see a short footage from Gamespot "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"here","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.gamespot.com/videos/gs-news-update-mega-man-11-announced-for-ps4-xbox-/2300-6442072/","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", and a commented set of images by Business Insider "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"here","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"http://www.businessinsider.com/nintendo-ps4-xbox-mega-man-11-2017-12?IR=T/#for-instance-everything-in-this-image-that-looks-cracked-is-destructible-with-a-charged-shot-8","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Good news for Megaman fan, which come out in occasion of its 30th anniversary, aren’t over: Capcom has also announced that:"}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"ORDERED_LIST","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Megaman Legacy Collection 1 and 2 are coming to Nintendo Switch, and that"}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"all eight Megaman X games are coming to Switch, PS4, Xbox One, and PC!"}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}}]}],"orderedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"You can check all the latest news about Megaman also on "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"its twitter stream","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://twitter.com/MegaMan","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Overwatch eSports news"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Germany has founded the first eSports federation","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"http://www.esportsinsider.com/2017/11/esports-bundes-deutschland-founded-featuring-esl-biu-various-german-teams/","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":": it is called "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"eSports-Bund Deutschland","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". This marks a new goal for the the eSports-as-sports cause. There is still "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"[text lost in a move]","decorations":[{"type":"CUT"}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Also, "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Wired features eSports","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":" declaring: “"}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"The Overwatch Videogame League Aims to Become the new NFL","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.wired.com/story/overwatch-videogame-league-aims-to-become-new-nfl/","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"” – it’s a strong title, but it doesn’t surprise us!"}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"We’ll always keep an eye out for you, watching eSports news. Blizzard has recently featured a video on how becoming an Overwatch hero, as it is upgrading their rulings about that. "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Take a look","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LPN5Wbi8jtg","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"!"}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Anime"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Hunter x Hunter hiatus ending"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"38ba49_1ece8af010744d51812f0b63f43aac66~mv2.png"},"width":800,"height":449},"altText":""}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Fresh, good news for the "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Hunter x Hunter series: ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"its latest hiatus will end next january","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://kotaku.com/hunter-x-hunters-latest-hiatus-will-end-next-january-1820968486","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". HxH fans are used to Yoshihiro Togashi’s work, which depends, at least in part, by his health issues: his longest one lasted 80 issues, so the last one is very short, for sure."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"IGN’s Best Anime nominees"}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"On 20th December 2017, "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"IGN will assign the “Best Anime TV Series of 2017”","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"You can check their nominees list here","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"http://www.ign.com/wikis/best-of-2017-awards/Anime_of_the_Year","target":"TOP"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":". We’re, of course, going to cover the award winner when it comes out with a review."}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":" "}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}}]}}